    <!-- Remote view (bridgit.cc/watch), RemoteView.kt -->
    <string name="settings_remote_view">Remote view</string>
    <string name="settings_remote_view_desc">Watch what your control agents do on this phone from anywhere, at bridgit.cc/watch, signed in with Google. The phone sends one short line per control agent action (the time, the control agent\'s name and which part of the phone, like Camera) and which parts are switched on. While the Pet monitor runs it also sends what your dog is doing and today\'s totals, and its newest photo unless you turn that off on the Pet monitor screen. Otherwise never photos, audio, screenshots, what was said or typed, notification or card text, or locations. Off deletes it all on the server.</string>
