    <string name="link_web_view_applet_privacy">Only Pet monitor on this device uses this portal. New observations and daily totals are uploaded after setup. Photos follow the photo-sharing switch in Pet monitor. Earlier history stays on the device. Deleting the web portal stops monitoring and removes its server history, app details and viewer access. Local records and your account connection stay.</string>
